{"id": 35, "name": "Hilda", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e71f7aa2d75cd340da108318b3d5a3f1.png", "cls": ["Fighter", "Tank"], "specialty": ["Damage", "Regen"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["90", "40", "40", "40"], "lanes": ["Roam", "Exp Lane"], "story": "Inheritor of the Power of the Megalith.", "skills": [{"name": "Blessing of Wilderness", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_34b0dddc37a0bd20d686616d9b7b984e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Hilda recovers 2% HP per second while in the bush. Entering a bush enhances her next Basic Attack, which deals 110<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+130% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+12*Hero Level)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the target, reduces the target's Movement Speed by 40%, and deals 40<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+10*Hero Level)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies behind the target. After using the enhanced Basic Attack, this effect enters a 6s cooldown.\n\nHilda's Basic Attack and skills apply a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Wilderness Mark</span> on hit, which lasts up to 4s and stacks up to 6 times. Each stack reduces the enemy hero's Physical Defense and Magic Defense by 3%."}, {"name": "Combat Ritual", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c2ffa9fe6df7c70e85144e9250f0f5bf.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Hilda gains 60% Movement Speed for 3s and receives a shield that absorbs damage equal to 10% Max HP, lasting 3s."}, {"name": "Art of Hunting", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2f407178c40dbabccf8d787b2e0e30cc.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7", "desc": "Hilda locks onto an enemy target, dealing 220<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> per hit. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The 2nd attack deals extra damage to nearby enemies. The 3rd attack deals damage to the target and nearby enemies, knocking them back briefly."}, {"name": "Power of Wildness", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_323f1e87195d3a50d0c307f239241b61.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 32", "desc": "Hilda launches a powerful slash at the target enemy, dealing 600<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+250% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and stunning them for 0.2s. Nearby enemies take 60% of the damage.\n\nEach stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Wilderness Mark</span> increases <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Power of Wildness</span>'s damage by 2.5% of the target's Max HP. At max stacks, the extra damage increases to 20% of the target's Max HP."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7045efd7cf5bcb488594a7eac3ab4e2.png"}, {"name": "Blade of the Heptaseas", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b79e4ea658ca0ff70c98c3d82e582348.png"}, {"name": "Sea Halberd", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d78fb27df8def66bd1460e851bfbf7a9.png"}, {"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f523b2a5fb397bd5f37475b5f0b4fbd1.png"}, {"name": "Blade of Despair